will be hosting at the Google

00:31:02.520 --> 00:31:04.500
Launch Pad in San Francisco.

00:31:04.500 --> 00:31:07.740
They actually do things all
across the United States,

00:31:07.740 --> 00:31:08.970
as well as worldwide.

00:31:08.970 --> 00:31:11.400
They're a program
called Girls Make Games.

00:31:11.400 --> 00:31:15.420
They basically run game jams,
as well as mostly summer camps,

00:31:15.420 --> 00:31:18.000
