build games, deploy games.

00:31:31.860 --> 00:31:33.130
It's really, really cool.

00:31:33.130 --> 00:31:35.730
It's over the summer
period, around July 10th.

00:31:35.730 --> 00:31:38.580
They have a variety of locations
across the United States

00:31:38.580 --> 00:31:40.554
for the summer period
when kids are off school.

00:31:40.554 --> 00:31:41.470
FRANCESC CAMPOY: Cool.

00:31:41.470 --> 00:31:43.053
